 publish('PRODUCTION_COMMANDS.md','# Executed finite A07 commands\n\nPRODUCTION_COMMANDS.json contains actual interpreter/script paths, all flags and immutable source identities for every job. CPU-only worker7.py supervises a single declared R5 job, removes credential variables, disables CUDA and caps AS32GiB/four BLAS threads. fit_other_five.py uses at most two workers. Initial invocation names exactly TF/final_norm/seed42 and splice/final_norm/seed42; five subsequent task batches reuse these seals without refitting. build_other_five_cache.py concatenates verified A06 chunks unchanged. INITIAL_PRODUCTION_GATE.json was PASS before remaining task batches.\n\nAll 390 units are sealed and excluded from automatic rerun. Do not rerun a head to fix a report or path. Unsealed output is quarantined, never trusted by existence alone. Resume with the exact manifest/source/cache identity; allocate a new job name for a justified retry and preserve old diagnostics. No A08 executable is dispatched.\n')
 publish('RESTORE.md','# Portable private A07 recovery\n\nBACKUP_VERIFICATION.json pins five task archives in the existing private dataset. For each, download its exact revision/path into a new cache; verify size, SHA256, safe exact regular-file member set and every member digest. archive7.safe_extract rejects duplicates, traversal, links, absolute paths, normalized aliases and unlisted members.\n\nEach archive contains 78 producer units, complete CV/head/prediction/bootstrap artifacts, small saved original-base heads, fold/draw/reference objects, source/environment/approval snapshots and cache metadata/seals. Unchanged large A06 feature chunks are referenced by their pinned archive revision and SHA, not repacked. The inherited fresh A06 consumer was rehashed and explicitly reused; this is not another download.\n\nRun frozen CPU Python `-B <new-consumer>/artifacts/code/restore7.py --root <new-consumer> --dependency-map <immutable-map.json> --task <task>`. The map contains A06_feature_consumer and member_manifest_sha256 from REUSED_A06_FEATURE_CONSUMER.json. Restore reads only consumer-relative new objects and explicit verified inherited consumer members, never producer paths. It reconstructs layer16/final_norm × three seeds × both policies for each task, with all metrics and all four references/2000 saved grouped draws: 12 paths and240 complete paired vectors per task,60/1200 total. No fitting occurs. All paired vectors, common validity masks and intervals are checked at1e-12; probabilities at1e-10.\n\nThe later metadata archive deterministically regenerates all12300 A05 keys and table descriptor joins. CPU recovery does not establish full GPU/runtime recreation or replace A08 full-unit independent release/30 CV refits. Separate final receipt binds scientific and later metadata commits without self-hash cycles.\n')
 nexttext='# A08 readiness and required scope\n\nBind actual A07 delivery, this prompt `'+cfg['prompt_commit']+'`, coverage `'+cfg['coverage_plan_sha256']+'`, CPU source SHA `'+sha(C/'CPU_SOURCE_IDENTITY.json')+'`, exact390-unit manifest and five private checkpoints. New390 heads/applications remain COMPLETE_UNVERIFIED. A08 has not started. Require separate direct approval and a revised prompt bound to the actual delivery.\n\nIndependently reconstruct all390 units/both policies and every marginal/paired draw from saved outputs; audit all folds, selection traces, typed provenance and tolerances. Execute only the frozen30 full-CV-plus-final refits (all5tasks × layer16/final_norm ×3seeds;480 initial solver calls), reusing all6 completed H3 audit refits and historical released results. No new extraction, historical fitting, control fitting, replacement draws or model training.\n\nThen calculate only predeclared eligible16380 adjacent classifier rows for R4−R3, R5−R4 and R6−R5 and70 paired LM rows across five frozen families from saved outputs. Keep both R2-dependent adjacent gaps, R3 domain-specific1092classifier/7LM eligibility and nonadjacent R3−R1/R6−R4 labels explicit. Preserve original evidence/lineage, no-deadline amendment, observer STOPPED and separate subsequent-stage gate. Do not edit prompt contracts as a scientific executor.\n'
